<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id">Ruth</book>
  <para style="h">Ruth</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ruth</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ruth</para>
  <para style="mt">Ruth</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thukhente in a uh hun lai-in khum gam sungah kielpi khat tung a, Judah gam Bethlehem khuomi khat, a zi le a tapa ni tawh Moab gama teng dingin a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua pa’ min Elimelech ahi a, a zinu’ min Naomi hi-in, a tapa nite’ min pen Mahlon le Chilion ahi hi; ama gel pen Judah gam Bethlehem-a Ephrathah-te ahi uhi. Ama gel Moab gamah pei-in tuanah a teng den uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hizongle Naomi’ pasal Elimelech si a, a tapa ni tawh ama a nuasie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tam tegel in Moab-te zi-in a la uhi; khat nu’ min Orpah ahi a, adang khat’ min Ruth ahi hi. Khum munah kum sawm sung bang a ten zaw ciengun
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mahlon le Chilion zong a ni gelin si a, a tapa ni le a pasal in tua nupi nu a nuasie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin a mo tegel tawh Moab gam pana kilekia dingin a kisa hi. Azieh pen Topa in a mite ve a, an neh tuidawn a pieh dan thute Moab gam panin ama in za zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n a tenna mun panin a mo tegel tawh Judah gam peikia dingin a lampi vuah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin Naomi in a mo tegel kungah, “Na inn tuoh vuah pei ta unlen, na nute utawh om un. A sisate le kei tungah nei lim bawl bangun Topa in hing limbawl taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa in na pasalkia uh’ inn tuohah lungnopna mu dingin hing siem taheh,” a ci hi. Tua bepin ama gel namin awngin a kikaa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama gel in ama kungah, “Hi lo e, na mite kungah ko zong hing pei va ung,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin Naomi in, “Kilekia zaw un, ka tanute aw, bang dinga kei ei zui ding na hi uh ahei? No gel’ pasal ding tapa neikia lai ding ka mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kilekia un, ka tanute aw, na inn vuah pei un; azieh pen pasal nei dingin kei ka vuoi ta hi. Pasal nei dingin kilamen ma leng zong tu zan mama-in pasal nei kia-in, tapa neikia phiel ta ma leng zong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a gol dong uh ngah zo ding na hi uh amah? Hi lo hi, ka tanute aw, Topa in kei ei bawlsiet ziehin no sangin kei ka lung a khamzaw hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin awgingin a kikaa kia uhi. Orpah in a innpinu namin mangpha pai a, hinanle Ruth in a innpinu a bel lenlon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n Naomi in, “En vawi, a mipite le a pasien-te kungah na guolnu peikia zo hi. Na guolnu nua kizui ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin Ruth in, “Nang nuasie nading ahi a, nang kang zuina panin ka kinuale nading ahi zongin ei pausawl da in! Na peipeina-ah ka pei ding hi; na giegiena-ah ka gieh ding hi; na mite keima’ mi hi ding a, na Pasien keima’ Pasien hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na sisina-ah ka si ding a, tuanah ka kivui ding hi, sina nangawn in nang kung panin ei khen leh Topa in ei dawm sih hinlen, a nasie zaw-in ei bawl lai taheh!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Naomi in ama a zui ding a khentat lam a thei bepin ama kungah bangma gen nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaci’n Bethlehem a tun dongun a ni gelin a peisuoh uhi. Bethlehem a tun tahun ama gel ziehin a khuozangun a linglawng vua, nupite in, “Tam nu Naomi ma amah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in amahaw kungah, “Naomi ei ci nawn sih unlen, Mara ei ci un. Azieh pen Vanglienpa in nahpi tahin ei gimsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A dimletin ka peikhie a, ahi vangin Topa in a hawmin ei tunpikia hi; Topa in kei ei huotbawlin Vanglienpa in ka tungah gimna ang tunsah zaw ciengin, bang dingin kei Naomi ei ci na hi uh ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaci’n Moab gam pana a kilekia a monu Moab numei Ruth tawh Naomi a peikia hi. Ama gel pen Bethlehem ah mangbuham lah kipat laitahin a tung uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Naomi in a pasal lam panin a sanggam, Elemelech innsung mi Boaz a kici mihau mi thupi khat nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moab numei Ruth in Naomi kungah, “Lo-ah ei kuonsah inlen, maipha ka muna popo pa’ nua-ah ansangh va khon ta vang,” a ci hi. Ama in, “Va pei tan, ka tanu aw,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama kuonin anlate nua-ah ansangh a khon hi. Tuale Elimelech’ innkuon Boaz’ lo ah a va kuonkha ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua zaw lienin Bethlehem panin Boaz ang pei a, ama in anlate kungah, “Note tawh Topa hing om taheh” a ci hi. Amate in zong, “ Topa in nang thupha hing pie taheh,” ci-in a dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin anlate a uh a nasempa kungah, “Tam koi’ ngahnu ahiei? a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Anlate a uh a nasempa in, “Moab gam pana Naomi tawh ang kilekia Moab numei ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua numei in, ‘Kang thum hi, ansangh ei khonsah inlen anlate’ nua-a bulomte lahah a tuolkiete ei tungsah in,’ ei ci hi. Tuaci’n ama ang pei-in zingmawnga kipanin tu cieng dongin bakhat sung nangawn khawl loin a sem hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin Boaz in Ruth kungah, “Tu-in ngai in ka tanu aw, ansangh khon dingin lo dangah kuon sin, tam lo nuasie sinlen ka nasem numeite gei-ah om lenlon in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lolai-ah an kilahna sa en lenlon inlen, amau’ nua zui in. Tangvalte in nang ang bawlsiet lo nadingin thu ka pie zo hi. Na dang a ta leh pei inlen tui beel sunga tangvalte’ tui tawisa dawn in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin tuol kunsuhin khupbawh a, “Kei gamdang mi khat hi lel bo ing a, bang dinga kei nei hici phaw a, na maipha ka mukhah adiei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin Boaz in ama dawngin, “Na pasal a si zaw-a kipanin na innpinu na limbawlna le na nu na pa le na pienna gam nuasie-in na thei ngai lo mite kunga nang peina thu a kimin ei kigen zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in na silbawlte ziehin thaman hing pie-in, ama’ hla hlim nei bel dinga nang zot Israel-te’ Pasien Topa tung panin thaman bucing nga ta in!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin Ruth in, “Ka pu aw, na mai-ah maipha ei ngasah zom lai in. Azieh pen kei na nasem numeite lahah khat zong ahi lo kimlai, na nasemnu tungah nang kamsiem a, nei hlamuongsah hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Boaz in anneh hun ciengin tua nu kungah, “Tanah hing pei in, anlum pawlkhat ne inlen, lenggazu sungah na an die in,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n anlate gei-ah ama to-in tua pa in bukan kimkhat a pie hi. Ama in a kham masangsie ne a, khamval pawlkhat omlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ansangh khonin ama a dinkia ciengin Boaz in a tangvalte hil a, “Buphai lahte nangawnah na khonsah unlen na maizumsah sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Anlom kihensate lah panin zong kimkhat ladawhin ama’ khon dingin na nuasie unlen ama na phawhsie sih un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in nitah dongin lolai-ah ansangh a khon hi. Tua ciengin ama in a khonsate cil a, mangbuham ephah khat bang a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in tuate puo-in khuo sungah a pei a, ama in ansangh bangza khon ci a innpinu in a mu hi. Tua ciengin ama in a an khawnla teng zong la-in a innpinu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A innpinu in ama kungah, “Tuni-in hei sungah ansangh na va khon tai? Koi’ lo-ah na kuon ei? Nang ang phawhkha pa in thupha nga taheh,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama in a innpinu kungah a naseppite thu gen a, “Tuni-a ka na sepna pa’ min Boaz ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin Naomi in a monu kungah, “A migitna in a hinglaite ahi a, a sisate ahi zongin a nuasiesah vawt lo Topa in ama thupha pie taheh!” a ci hi. Naomi in ama kungah, “Tua mipa khu i tanaute, i kinaipi pente lahah khat ahi hi,” zong a cibe lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moab numei Ruth in, “Ama in ka kungah, ‘Ka anlah sieng zaw masangsie ka nasemte kungah om in,’ ei ci lai hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Naomi in a monu Ruth kungah, “Ka tanu aw, a numeite tawh na kuonton pen hoizaw hi. Tua hi sihle lo dangah ang kibawlsie kha ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaci’n Boaz’ numeite nai-ah Ruth om a, mangbu le mangbuham lah zo masangsie ansangh khonin a innpinu tawh a omton hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A innpinu Naomi in ama kungah, “Ka tanu aw, na nopsah nadingin sil muonhuoi khat kang suipieh ding kisam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A nasem ngahnute tawh na nasepna i sanggampa Boaz tanah tu-in a om hi. En in, ama in tu zanin ancilna-ah mangbuham zoi-in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kisilin sathau kinu inlen na puon hoipente silin ancilna lamah peisuh in; ahi vangin a neh a dawn a man masangsie ama kungah na pei lam kitheisah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama a lup ciengin a lupna encien in; tua ciengin, pei-in a keng lem inlen lum in; tuale ama in na bawl ding ang gen ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in a kungah, “Na gen zosie ka bawl ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama ancilna-ah peisuhin a innpinu hil bang tehtehin a gamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Boaz in a neh a dawn zaw ciengin a lung nuom a, a lum dingin anphuol gei-ah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zankim laitahin thakhatin khangloin a kihei leh a khawdop-ah numei khat na lum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in, “Nang koi na hiei?” a ci hi. Tua nu in dawng a, “Kei na nasemnu Ruth ka hi hi; na puon tawh na nasemnu ei hui in, azieh pen ka tanau kinaipi pen na hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in, “ Topa in nang thupha hing pie taheh, ka ta nu aw; tam a nukhia pen na citahna in a cil lai-a sangin hoizaw peh hi; nang in a hau hitale a zawng hitale tangvalte’ nua po na zui sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu-in ka tanu aw, zau sinlen na nget zosie kang seppieh ding hi. Azieh pen ka khuo-a mi zosie in numei kizen na hi lam a thei uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanle tu-in na sanggam kinaipi pen khat ka hi khu a man vangin kei sanga na kinaipizaw adang sanggam khat omlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuzanin tanah om tadi inlen, zingmawng ciengin na tungah tanau kinaipi pente’ mawpuoh ang sep leh hoi hi; ama semsah in. Ama in nang tungah tanau kinai pente’ mawpuoh ang sep nuom sih leh, Topa a hing ahi ma bangin keima in nang tungah tanau kinaipi pente’ mawpuoh teng kang sem ding hi. Zingmawng dongin tam sungah lum in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n zingmawng dongin a khawdop-ah tua nu lum a, ahi vangin mi mel kimucien thei masangin ama a tho hi; azieh pen Boaz in, “Ancilna phuol-a nang pei lam koima in kitheisah sin,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in, “Na puon hing la inlen daw in,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n tua nu in daw a, ama in mangbuham law guh te-in a guonpieh hi; tua ciengin ama khuopi sungah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A innpinu kungah ama a tun ciengin na dong a, ”Ka tanu aw, bang nang ci ei?” a ci ciengin tua nu in zong ama’ tungah tuapa’ bawlna zosie gen a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Tam mangbuham law guh ei guon hi, azieh pen ama in, ‘Na innpinu kungah na khutguohin pei sin,’ ei ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Naomi in, “Ka tanu aw, thu bang hing ci pien ding ci na thei masangin ngah tadi in, azieh pen ama ang mawh op sih ding a, tuni-in vai zosie ang siengsah na ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kulpi tunkotah Boaz peito-in khumnah a to zaw lienin, a tanau a kinaipi pen, Boaz in a gen mipa a pei hi. Tuaci’n Boaz in, “Lawm aw, hing pei in; tanah hing to in,” a ci hi. Tuale ama pei-in a to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin Boaz in khuo upa sawm zawpi-in ama in, “Tanah to un,” a ci hi; tuaci’n amate a to uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in a tanau kinaipi pen kungah, “Moab gam pana ang kilekia Noami in i sanggampa Elimelech’ leitang phalkhat a zua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tam thu nang kungah gen dingin ka ngaisun a, ‘Tam sunga a to mite’ mitmu le ka upate’ mitmu-in lei in,’ kang ci hi. Na tat ding le tan in; na tat sih ding leh a thu ka thei nadingin ei gen in; bangzieh ahei cile nang masangah a tan ding mi koima om lo hi. Nang zom kei ka hi hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama in, “Keima’n tan vang,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Boaz in, “Naomi khut sung pan tua leitang na lei ni-a kipanin a sipa’ gamh pen a sipa’ min tawh a op suoh thei nadingin a sipa’ zi meigongnu Ruth zong a leitha na hi pai ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuale a tanau kinaipi pen pa in, “Keima’ gouluo kisusie loin keima adingin tam ka tan thei sih ding hi. Ka tat theina khuon nang mama-in kilah tan, azieh pen ke’n ka tan thei sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nidang lai-a Israel-te sungah tatna le kikhelna thu tawh kisai ngaina tam bang ahi hi: vaihawmna khat a kip ahi nadingin mi khat in a kedap suo-in adang khat tungah a pie hi; tam pen kipsahna bawldan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n a tanau kinaipi pen pa in Boaz kungah, “Nangma dingin kilei in,” a ci ciengin ama in a kedap a sut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin Boaz in upate le mi zosie kungah, “Tuni-in Naomi tung panin Elimelech, Chilion le Mahlon’ neisa zosie ka lei zawhna thu teci na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A tanaute le a pienna khuo tunkot panin misi pa’ min a kisuhmang lo nadingin, ama’ gamhluona-ah misi pa’ min a kizop thei nadingin Mahlon’ zi meigong Moab mi Ruth zong ka zi dingin ka la zo ta hi; tuni-in no teng tecite na hi uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin tunkota om mi zosie le upate in, “Ko teci ka hi uhi. Topa in Israel minam a piengsah Rachel le Leah bangin na inn sunga ang lut numei nu hing bawl taheh. Ephrathah ah ta le nau nei inlen, Bethlehem ah na minthang taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in tam numeino tungtawna ang pieh ding tate, Judah in Tamar tawh a nei Perez innkuon bang taheh,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaci’n Boaz in Ruth la-in ama a zi a suoh hi. Ama gel a lupton ciengun Topa in ama gaisah a, tapa khat nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin nupite in Naomi kungah, “Tuni-in tanau kinaipi pen nei loin ang omsah lo Topa in thupha nga ta hinlen; tuale Israel-te sungah ama’ min thang taheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama pen hinna ang piekia pa, le na vuoi cienga ang va pa hi ding hi; azieh pen na tapa sagi sangin a thupizaw, nang ang it na monu’ nei tapa ahi hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin Naomi in nausen la-in a kang sungah tawi a, nau cingnu a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A veng nupite in ama’ min a phuo pieh vua, “Naomi sung pan tapa khat suoh,” a ci uhi. Amate in a min Obed a phuo uhi; ama pen Jessi’ pa suoh a, Jessi pen David’ pa a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu-in tam teng pen Perez’ suonlehlahte ahi hi: Perez pen Hezron’ pa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hezron pen Ram’ pa, Ram pen Amminadab’ pa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amminadab pen Nahshon’ pa, Nahshon pen Salmon’ pa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Salmon pen Boaz’ pa, Boaz pen Obed’ pa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Obed pen Jessi’ pa, Jessi pen David’ pa ahi hi.
  </para>
</usx>
